===Determiner===
{{head|sv|determiner form}}

# {{neuter singular of|sv|all}}
#: {{ux|sv|Har du druckit upp '''allt''' vatten?|Have you drunk up '''all''' (of the) water?}}

====Usage notes====
* '''{{l|sv|all}}''' and '''{{l|sv|allt}}''' are the words to use about uncountable [[mass noun]]s (of common and neuter gender, respectively) and {{l|sv|alla}} is used about countable in the plural.

